### Cadastrar funcionário: esperado 201
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "João Souza",
    "email": "joao@logistica.local",
    "senha": "Logistica@123"
}

### Login com funcionário do script SQL
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ana@logistica.local",
    "senha": "Logistica@123"
}

### Senha incorreta: esperado 401
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ana@logistica.local",
    "senha": "errada"
}

### Sem autenticação: esperado 401
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas

### Cadastrar motorista: esperado 201
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "nome": "José Pereira",
    "cnh": "12345678904",
    "cpf": "98765432104",
    "telefone": "11988887777"
}

### Listar motoristas com CPF e CNH legíveis: esperado 200
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

### Buscar por nome: esperado 200
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas?nome=José
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

### Consultar motorista: esperado 200
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

### Atualizar motorista: esperado 200
PUT http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "telefone": "11977776666"
}

### Cadastrar carga: esperado 201
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "descricao": "Caixas de livros",
    "peso": 120.5,
    "volume": 1.2,
    "codigoRastreio": "100004",
    "idMotorista": 1
}

### Listar cargas: esperado 200
GET http://localhost:3000/cargas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

### Cadastrar entrega: esperado 201
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "cidadeDestino": "Sorocaba",
    "status": "TRANSITO",
    "data": "2026-10-28",
    "hora": "09:30:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}

### Atualizar status: esperado 200
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "status": "ENTREGUE",
    "data": "2026-10-28",
    "hora": "15:30:00"
}

### Listar entregas ordenadas: esperado 200
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas?ordem=ASC
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

### Filtrar intervalo, mais recentes primeiro: esperado 200
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas?dataInicio=2026-10-25&dataFim=2026-10-28&ordem=DESC
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

### Status inválido: esperado 400
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "status": "CANCELADO"
}

### Apagar motorista sem carga (ajuste o código após listar): esperado 200
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/4
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
